  "question": {
    "text": "Two capacitors $\\mathrm{C}_{1}$ and $\\mathrm{C}_{2}$ are charged to $120 \\mathrm{~V}$ and $200 \\mathrm{~V}$ respectively. It is found that by connecting them together the potential on each one can be made zero. Then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
