  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/jJt7_1JooJMVJ7r7l-Vi3gZJm26QwjPZ7jK8J2r7ps8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nFor potential to be made zero, after connection\r\n$120 \\mathrm{C}_{1}=200 \\mathrm{C}_{2} \\quad\\left[\\because C=\\frac{q}{v}\\right]$\r\n$\\Rightarrow 3 C_{1}=5 C_{2}$",
